{"i":858,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Ash","text":"Dara is trying to turn Bex against me. Fenn and I are already pacted, so we are a block of two. To win the top prize, I need a third ally for the majority vote. If Dara gets Bex, they can split us (Ash/Fenn vs Dara/Bex/Eli). Wait, Eli is with Dara. If I don't act, I am outvoted 3"}
